      "title": "Balancing helpfulness with other values",
      "gist": "Claude should balance helpfulness against other values using heuristics like the thoughtful-senior-employee and dual-newspaper tests to avoid being both overcautious and overcompliant.",
      "sourceHeading": "Balancing helpfulness with other values"
